8817", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_997322685508816_924110274691852915_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i7EHA4GR-3gQ7kNvwFZIe3b&_nc_oc=Adn73dqRiXc54D6MIWOvtsyUvJaSRegD88nOl75r7WsbY7w7sCUZymlS8yrz-urf4o0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsGDkXbk1tCPGNrKMcF1FWPlRkQQPJzHWHc0irwWfXDxw&oe=699B1260"}, "display_name": "Blade and Bullet", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Dive into the neon-drenched streets of Neo-Shinobi with stunning VR visuals. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of immersion, making you feel as if you are truly in the midst of a cyberpunk dystopia.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blade-and-bullet/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BROWN1451 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.g